<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">26082026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The Syrian Democratic Forces, who held roughly a third of Syria and partnered with Washington against the Islamic State, have dissolved themselves as an independent army.</s> <s>What transfers to Damascus isn't just weapons — it's a parallel state, with its own conscription, its own courts, its own oil sales and its own prisons across the northeast.</s> <s>The fate of some ten thousand detainees at al-Hol and Hasakah remains unanswered.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Qalandia, armoured vehicles expelled twenty staff of the UN refugee agency from a training centre that served sixteen thousand Palestinian refugees across the occupied West Bank.</s> <s>A law passed by Israel's parliament in twenty twenty-four barring official contact with the agency lets authorities treat its compound as unclaimed land.</s> <s>The centre taught trades to a generation that has known no other route to work.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Camp committees in Gaza have ordered children's kites grounded.</s> <s>Israel's military now reads any airborne object crossing the boundary as a militant signature, and has threatened to kill those who launch them and clear the ground they fly from.</s> <s>A ceasefire that leaves a paper kite as a targeting decision is a ceasefire only in name.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two women died in police custody in Lahore, and Punjab's police chief answered by announcing that a forensic board found nine substances in their bodies.</s> <s>Custody imposes a duty of care that no toxicology report can discharge — the question is what guards did, not what the dead had taken.</s> <s>No magistrate's inquiry has been named, and no officer has been suspended.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An area council chairman in Kuje, inside Nigeria's federal capital territory, told residents on camera to vote for the ruling party or leave.</s> <s>The threat is credible precisely because of the office — a chairman allocates market stalls, land certificates for informal occupancy, refuse and water contracts, and none of that requires a court to withdraw.</s> <s>Amnesty International warns the words could incite violence, and so far the federal authorities have said nothing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Two people were killed by a United States military strike on a boat in international waters, with no boarding, no charge and no court.</s> <s>Interdiction at sea is a policing act governed by arrest and prosecution... and calling a vessel a military target swaps a battlefield rule in, a claim with no natural boundary in geography or category.</s> <s>Nobody survived to be tried, so the only account of what that boat carried belongs to the party that destroyed it.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Women in Nampula, in northern Mozambique, made the capulana — the printed wrap cloth almost every woman there already owns — the sign of their protest.</s> <s>It's a symbol that can't be confiscated, banned, or held up in court as evidence of membership, and policing depends on telling participants from bystanders.</s> <s>Unable to draw that line, police dispersed everyone, and organisers now face prosecution for what they posted.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hundreds of people walked six days along the Kok River in Chiang Rai, where arsenic and lead now exceed safety limits in several riverside communities.</s> <s>The river rises in Myanmar's Shan State, where Chinese-financed mining sits entirely beyond Thai jurisdiction — the poison crosses a border the remedy cannot.</s> <s>The walkers are demanding a state response to contamination no Thai agency has the authority to stop at its source.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>An Allahabad High Court bench has refused a schoolgirl's plea to wear her headscarf with her uniform.</s> <s>Indian courts decide these cases through the essential religious practice doctrine, under which a judge — not a scholar, not the believer — rules on whether an observance is essential enough to deserve protection, a test that's stripped as often as it's shielded.</s> <s>The court accepted the school's private status first, narrowing her rights claim before the religious question was ever reached.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Iran and Oman have declared a temporary joint corridor through the Strait of Hormuz, paired with a mine-clearing project, agreed during the Omani foreign minister's visit to Tehran.</s> <s>Notice the word temporary — a surveyed lane with declared entry points makes transits schedulable and therefore insurable, which is what actually moves a war-risk premium, and it leaves Tehran able to close what it has just opened.</s> <s>Washington had declared the strait clear days earlier; it's Omani mediation, not a navy, that has produced the first thing insurers can price.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Vladimir Putin has signed a decree letting the Russian state seize industrial facilities whose owners fail to buy their own air defence.</s> <s>Russia's military doesn't have enough interceptors to cover every refinery drones have reached, so the cost of protection moves onto private balance sheets.</s> <s>It's a quiet admission of scarcity dressed as a security requirement.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Thirty-nine state banking associations in the United States have announced a rival blockchain, though they've yet to hire anyone to build it.</s> <s>The fear underneath is deposits: a stablecoin that pays no interest at all still drains the cheap funding that bank lending is built on.</s> <s>An alliance with a launch date and no technology partner is a statement of anxiety more than a product.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ottawa is matching Washington's tariffs dollar for dollar, with a list that taxes perfume, golf clubs and games consoles.</s> <s>The arithmetic is brutally asymmetric — Canada sends about three-quarters of its exports south, while receiving a fifth of its imports in return.</s> <s>Canadian households will pay the tariffs their own government just imposed.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Five years after the twenty twenty-one floods, the water around Rotriak in South Sudan has never receded, and more than fifty submerged oil wells are leaching into it.</s> <s>The flooding washed away the lined pits that once held produced water, so heavy metals now move freely into marshes families drink from and fish.</s> <s>Clinicians there report rising illness, in a place with almost no capacity to prove the cause.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Global sea-surface temperature reached twenty-one point one degrees Celsius on Saturday, a record.</s> <s>The ocean has absorbed most of the excess heat humanity has produced, so a record here isn't weather — it's the buffer filling up.</s> <s>Warmer water expands and stratifies, driving most of sea-level rise and cutting the oxygen mixing that fisheries depend on, Copernicus says.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A fur seal in Australia tested positive for H five N one on Sunday, and researchers are watching elephant seals next.</s> <s>Seals recognise one another by touching noses, the same close contact through which influenza has passed between birds and mammals elsewhere — and seal-to-seal spread would mean the virus is adapting to mammals.</s> <s>None of Australia's monitored colonies have shown that yet, God willing they won't.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Immigration enforcement officers in the United States are seeking a single national voter database, built by a contractor merging fifty public state files and matching them against immigration records.</s> <s>No law authorised the merger — a procurement did, which is a far lower bar than legislation and far less visible.</s> <s>Naturalised citizens and mixed-status households may simply stop registering once they see where their data flows.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A network of more than a hundred articles about Palestine has been written not for readers but for chatbots.</s> <s>Retrieval systems summarise a handful of documents and can't weigh institutional credibility, so a byline-free domain that looks official passes as authority.</s> <s>Anyone asking an assistant about Palestine may now receive that framing back as the answer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers have built an intrusion detector for the network inside a car, trained across many vehicles without raw driving records ever leaving any of them.</s> <s>The flaw they're defending is forty years old: the bus carrying messages between brakes, engine and steering authenticates nothing, because when it was standardised nothing in a car talked to the outside world — and everything since has bolted a radio onto it.</s> <s>The paper's still early access and tested on datasets, not roads, but the exposure it describes is already on every street.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Satellite analysts who identified Chinese stealth jets from orbit were looking at firefighting practice targets.</s> <s>Imagery alone can only measure shape and size, so a plywood lookalike produces a detection identical to the real thing — and estimates of a fleet get built on that arithmetic.</s> <s>It's worth asking how many published force assessments rest on the same method.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>